\"guideline_section\":\"3. Annotate disease mentions that are used as Modifiers for other concepts\"},{\"start\":802,\"end\":817,\"text\":\"hemochromatosis\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"Refers to the specific disease hemochromatosis being mimicked. 'human' is an organism modifier and is excluded from the span.\",\"guideline_section\":\"1. Annotate all Specific Disease mentions; What NOT to annotate 1 (organism names excluded)\"},{\"start\":860,\"end\":873,\"text\":\"iron overload\",\"entity\":\"SpecificDisease\",\"rationale\":\"Describes a defined pathological condition (iron overload) that the mice develop, characterized by specific clinical features. It is treated as a disease mention in this context.\",\"guideline_section\":\"1. Annotate all Specific Disease mentions\"}]}", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4051, "output_tokens": 9672, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 8847}, "service_tier": "batch", "speed": "standard"}}}